# Master data files for the CLI importer (docs/importer.md).
# These hold the institution's real people — names, emails, phone numbers — and
# must never enter git history. Keep them on the machine that runs the import.
data/

# Source thesis document (46 MB binary).
# Its content is now extracted into docs/database-schema.md, docs/test-cases.md
# and docs/requirements.md, and the .docx itself has been removed from the
# working copy. The pattern stays as a guard: if anyone drops the original back
# in, it must not enter git history. See docs/spec-refactor-redeploy.md (D12).
docs/*.docx
